# RealtorOS — environment reference (documentation only)
#
# This is a static vanilla HTML/CSS/JS app with no build step and no
# server-side process, so nothing here is ever read or substituted at
# runtime. The browser only ever sees what is literally written into
# assets/js/config.js. This file exists purely so the two required values
# are documented in one place for whoever configures a new environment.
#
# Do NOT create a real .env from this file and expect it to do anything —
# copy these values into assets/js/config.js instead (see that file).

# Supabase project URL (public)
SUPABASE_URL=https://yanasorwmaybnabfuepn.supabase.co

# Supabase publishable ("anon") key (public — safe to ship to the browser)
SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_rACVZ0zvWjYtEhdxt1SyiA_XfRtUgrp

# NEVER put a Supabase service-role / secret key in this file, in
# config.js, or anywhere else in this static frontend. A service-role key
# bypasses Row Level Security entirely — it belongs only in a server-side
# environment (an edge function, a backend), never in code shipped to a
# browser.
